<title>USA: Fulton Cty, Ga. $50 mln notes won by Bankers Trust.</title>
<headline>Fulton Cty, Ga. $50 mln notes won by Bankers Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust said Wednesday it won $50 million Fulton County, Ga., tax anticipation notes at a net interest cost of 3.75468 percent. The notes carry a 4-1/4 percent coupon.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
